00:10:36,518 --> 00:10:37,518
Wow.

266
00:10:37,518 --> 00:10:38,518
What?

267
00:10:38,518 --> 00:10:39,518
Oh, my God.

268
00:10:39,518 --> 00:10:42,518
This is a little... What do we do with this?

269
00:10:42,518 --> 00:10:43,518
What is this?

270
00:10:43,518 --> 00:10:44,518
What do we do?

271
00:10:44,518 --> 00:10:46,518
Natsumi, minus 70.

272
00:10:46,518 --> 00:10:47,518
What's that?

273
00:10:47,518 --> 00:10:48,518
It's a flower.

274
00:10:48,518 --> 00:10:49,518
Can you write "flower"?

275
00:10:49,926 --> 00:10:52,370
I wonder if it was good... if anyone wrote it.

276
00:10:52,370 --> 00:10:54,370
Bingo!

277
00:10:54,370 --> 00:10:56,370
No, maybe not.

278
00:10:56,370 --> 00:10:58,370
Not even close.

279
00:10:58,370 --> 00:11:00,370
Not at all.

280
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:07,370
So, let me get my points straight.

281
00:11:07,370 --> 00:11:11,370
First, Momo-chan has 1.75 points

282
00:11:11,370 --> 00:11:15,370
And Ugi-chan has 0 points

283
00:11:15,370 --> 00:11:18,370
And I have 1 point

284
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:22,370
Kawanago is now Momo Kyun!

285
00:11:22,370 --> 00:11:24,370
I'm so happy!

286
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:26,370
Congratulations!

287
00:11:26,370 --> 00:11:28,370
Thank you!

288
00:11:28,370 --> 00:11:32,370
If I didn't have a lucky problem, I would have 0 points.

289
00:11:32,370 --> 00:11:35,370
What's your lucky problem?

290
00:11:35,370 --> 00:11:37,370
Well, I'll make one next time.

291
00:11:37,370 --> 00:11:40,370
I'll give you a second try, right?

292
00:11:40,370 --> 00:11:43,370
That's all for now, I'm Kawanago!

293
00:11:43,370 --> 00:11:45,370
Bye bye!

294
00:11:45,370 --> 00:11:47,370
It was fun!

295
00:11:48,370 --> 00:11:49,208
Bye bye!
